.Sh PROOF OBLIGATIONS
A proof of the esoteric half must:
.Bl -enum
.It
Exhibit
.Em O
.Pq current, B-field, impedance, squeezed magnetometry
and the traces it distinguishes.
.It
Factor or refuse to factor
.Em O
through
.Em pi : Tr -> Sub
.Pq credential, mapping, vnode
versus the plant alone.
.It
If it factors, show independence
.Pq imperviousness
or bound
.Em I(high; O)
or a distinguisher's advantage
.Pq resistance .
Do not conflate the two.
.It
If it does not factor, discharge the remainder outside
.Xr mac 4 :
PDN filter, constant power, shielding, air gap, or a secrecy
lattice / enclave whose analog
.Em O
is in the spec.
.It
Preserve LOMAC's axiom.
Do not derive no-read-down from a low-watermark.
If the goal is emanation secrecy, say so and change the lattice.
